<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Kuturikihwa KwoBhaibhiri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">Judhasi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raJudhasi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Judhasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba</para>
  <para style="mt1">raJUDHASI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba rinoitiwa Judhasi ridopasiwa zita romunyori warene, anova Judhasi. Judhasi anozviita hama yaJakobho, waiva munin'ina waJesu. Saka naiyeyuwo umwe wovanofungidzihwa kuti waiva munin'ina waJesu (Judhasi 1) Tinozivaba kana tsamba rakareri ridonyorehwa kuti itumihwe kuimwe yomakherekhe. Asi nondava yokutora zvinhu zvidosiyanasiyana kubva kuChibvumirano Chokare, tsamba rakareri rinoonewa kunge ridonyorehwa vaJudha. Kunyange zvidodaro zvazvene, tsamba rakareri rinoenda kunovese vadodaidziwa novanodiwa, vari muna Mwari Baba, futi vadochengetehwa Jesu Khirisitu. Tsamba rakareri raJudhasi rinenge ridonyohwa kwapera makore makumi matanhatu mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chinangwa chaJudhasi chokunyorera maKhirisitu tsamba rakareri nyhokuvapasa chenjedzo kuti vareke kutsambutsiwa novadzidzisi vomabhwodo (Judhasi 4). Anopasa muenzaniso wozvidoitika kuChibvumirano Chokare kuti asimbise kupasa kwache chenjedzo. Tsamba rakareri rinopfungwa dzidowanda dzidofanana nodziri muna 2 Pita, zvichisanganisira chenjedzo pamusoro povadzidzisi vomabhwodo (Judhasi 4, 2 Pita 2:1). Zvakarezvi zvinosanganisawo muenzaniso wonyaya yongirozi nonyaya yoSodhoma noGomora.</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Judhasi anothanga nokupasa shoko rorugare kuvaverengi votsamba yache (Judhasi 2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kubva pakarepo anodzopasa chikonzero chaadonyorera tsamba rache, chinova chokuonesa vatendi maitiro yanongozi yovadzidzisi vomabhwodo (Judhasi 3-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mumasure mozvakarezvo anopasa muenzaniso wovanhu nozvinhu zvomuChibvumirano Chokare (Judhasi 5-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino anodzopasa nzeru kuvaverengi vache dzozvinhu zvavanofanira kuita pamusoro pochenjedzo yavapasiwa (17-23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Judhasi anopedzisa tsamba rache nokurumbidza Mwari (Judhasi 24-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Judhasi, muranda waJesu Khirisitu, anova mukoma nomunin'ina’ina naJakobho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Kuno vadodaidziwa, vanova vadikani muna Mwari Baba novadochengetehwa Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Dai tsitsi, norugare, norudo zvaingidzihwa kwamuri.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vadzidzisi Vomabhwodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Vadikani, ndaiditsa kuti ndikunyorerei pamusoro poruponiso redu ratinoziva, ndidodzoona zvidonaka kukunyorerai ndichikukurudzirai kuhwira kuchengetedza kutenda kudopasiwa kabodzi basi kuvatsvene. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Nokuti panovadoverevedza ndokuerekana vava pakati penyu, ivovo vadogara vapasiwa kare kutongewa kwakareku kudonyohwa, mbanhu vasinai umwari vanomonyorora mutsa waMwari wedu vachiuita unosvaira vanhu kurarama nonzira isinai kuzvibata, vachiramba iye wega Tenzi wedu naIshe Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Kunyange maiziva zvakarezvi zvese, ndinoda kundokufungisai kuti panonguwa iyo Ishe paadonunura vanhu vache kubva kuIjipiti, asi mumasure mozvakarezvo adoparadza vaye vasinai kutenda. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Naidzo ngirozi futi dzisinai kuchengeta nzvimbo yadzene youkuru, asi dzidosiya nzvimbo chaiyo yadzene, adodzidira pamisungo yorima yokusingapere, kusvikira pakutongewa kwozuva rikuru. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Ndomwenze Sodhoma noGomora pabodzi nomaguta yadopoteredza, yadoita kunge ngirozi dzokaredzi, zvinonyangadza zvibodzibodzizvo zvoupombwe muenzaniso wovachatongewa nokudzotambudziwa nomoto wokusingapere.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Nonzira ibodzibodziyo, vanhu vakareva mukurota kwavo vanosvipisa miviri yavo, vanoramba ukuru pakare vachishora vaye vanokubhwinya. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Asi kana Mikaeri, ngirozi ikuru, paanga achipikisana naJabhurosi pamusoro pochitunha chaMozisi, haanai kumutukana, asi adondoti kwaari, “Ishe mbaakudzume.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Asi vanhu vakareva vanotukana zvese zvavasinganzvitsitse, futi vanoparadziwa nozvinhu zvavanotorera pamusoro, fanike zvinoitiwa nomhuka. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Nhamu kuno vakareva! Vadotetereka nonzira yaKhaini, vadosiya gwara ndokupinimidzira mubairo vachitaika fanike Bharamu, vadoparadziwa mukupanduka kwaKhora. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Vanhu vakareva vadosvipa pamitambo yenyu yokuwadzana. Pavanoja pabodzi naimimi vasingache, vanondozviitira hanya pachavo. Vakareva makuti yasinai mvura yanondogwididzihwa noduthu, miti yochirimo isinai michero, idodzuriwa ndokupfa kairi, <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />vadofanana nomapfeni yomvura yomugungwa yanopenga, vanonangidza kufumuka kwavo. Vadofanana nonyenyedzi dzinotizira dzonyangarika, vakareva vadochengetehwa rima nokusingapere.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Nondava yovakarevo Inoki wochinomwe kubva pana Adhamu adoporofita pamusoro pavo achiti, “Onai, Ishe ari kuuya nozviuru zvozviuru zvovatsvene vache, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />kudzotonga vese nokukomwesa vese vasinai umwari hwavadoita mukusaya umwari kwavo, nokuita zvinosora ukari pakusaya umwari kwovatadzi vadotaura zvokupikisa Mwari.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Vanhu vakareva mbanyunyuti vanoshora vamwe, vasingagutsikane vanotevera zvido zvavo, vanopamuromo vachizvikudza vanoita tsvete kunovamwe kuti vawane zvavanoda.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chenjedzo Nokuraira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Asi hama, munofanira kuyeuka, zvinhu zvidogara zvatauhwa nonhumwa dzaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />vadoti kwamuri, “Panguwa yokupedzisira, kuchava novashori, vachatevera zvido zvomwoyo yavo zvisinai umwari.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Ndivo vanhu vanokupesanisai, mbanhu vonyika vasinai Mweya. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Asi imimi, vadikani, zvivakhei mukutenda kwenyu kutsvene, munamate muMweya Mutsvene, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />muzvichengete murudo raMwari pamunenge muchimirira tsitsi dzaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu kuti dzikuisei kuupenyu husingapere.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Ivai notsitsi kuno vanotsakidza, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />ponesai vamwe, muchivabvuta mumoto, vamwe muvanzvire tsitsi muchicha, asi muchitozonda nombacha dzidotindivadziwa nonyama.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munamato Worumbidzo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Kuna iye anogona kukuchengetai kuti mureke kumbwera nokukusvitsai pakubhwinya kwache musinai chinoshoreka muno mufaro, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />kuna Mwari wega, Muponisi wedu kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu Ishe wedu, mbakuve nokubhwinya, ukuru, utongi, nomasimba, kubvira nguwa isati yavapo izvozvi nokusingapere. Ameni.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>